{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Dinosaur Egg is an ",["l","古物","artifact"]," and an ",["l","动物","animal product"],"."]],["p",["Initially, a Dinosaur Egg can be found by digging up an ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"]," in ",["l","深山","The Mountain"],"s (including the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],"), in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Fishing level 2"]," and having previously found at least one ",["l","古物","artifact"],", dropped from a ",["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"],", foraged on ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Prehistoric Floors","Prehistoric Floors"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", or won in the Crane Game in the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],". Dinosaur Egg can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物#Pets","pet"]," dog with max ",["l","动物#Friendship","friendship"],"."]],["p",["Dinosaur Eggs can be put into an ",["l","孵化器","incubator"]," in a ",["l","木匠的商店#Farm Buildings","Big or Deluxe Coop"]," to hatch a ",["l","恐龙","Dinosaur"]," ≈11 days later (≈6 days with the ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Coopmaster Profession"],"). Mature and fed dinosaurs will produce Dinosaur Eggs every 7 days."]]]],["Donation",2,[["p",["Donation of this item contributes to the total count of donations for the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],"."]],["p",["Tip: Placing the first Dinosaur Egg found into an incubator instead of donating it to the Museum will ensure that the player both obtains a Dinosaur and completes the Museum collection."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Artisan Goods",2,[["p",["See also: ",["l","加工动物制品的收益","Animal Products Profitability"]]],["p",["Dinosaur Eggs can be used to make the following ",["l","工匠物品","Artisan Good"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredient"]},{"h":1,"v":["Equipment"]},{"h":1,"v":["Time"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["f","Dinosaur_Mayonnaise.png",48]],[["l","恐龙蛋黄酱","Dinosaur Mayonnaise"]],["It's thick and creamy, with a vivid green hue. It smells like grass and leather."],[["i","(O)107","Dinosaur Egg ×1"]],[["f","Mayonnaise_Machine.png",40],["l","蛋黄酱机","Mayonnaise Machine"]],["3 Hours"],["800g"]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Dinosaur Egg is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Dinosaur Egg is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["A Dinosaur Egg can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["i","(H)43","Dinosaur Hat"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a green dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],". It can also be used as a green dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","任务#Gus' Famous Omelet","\"Gus' Famous Omelet\""],": On the Special Orders board in front of the ",["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor's Manor"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"]," may randomly request that the player collect and deliver 24 Eggs (of any type) to the fridge in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],". The reward is 3,000g and a ",["l","迷你冰箱","Mini-Fridge"],"."]]]]]],["Secret",2,[["p",["After hatching the first Dinosaur Egg, ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," will gift the player a ",["l","三倍浓缩咖啡","Triple Shot Espresso"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Introduced ",["l","恐龙蛋黄酱","Dinosaur Mayonnaise"]," -- prior to this, putting Dinosaur Eggs into a ",["l","蛋黄酱机","Mayonnaise Machine"]," resulted in gold-quality ",["l","蛋黄酱","Mayonnaise"],". Added as drop from ",["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"],", ",["l","电影院#Crane Game","Crane Game"]," prize, and foraged on Prehistoric Levels. Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": ",["l","古物","Artifacts"]," are now liked by the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," and ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", disliked by all other NPCs. Can be used for a ",["l","任务#List of Special Orders","Special Order"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Dinosaur Egg is now liked by Demetrius and Alex. Can now be gifted by a ",["l","动物#Pets","pet"]," dog with max ",["l","动物#Friendship","friendship"],". Dinosaur Egg sell values are now modified by the Treasure Appraisal Guide."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","恐龙","Dinosaur"],["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"]," in ",["l","深山","The Mountain"],"s/",["l","采石场","Quarry"]," (0.6%)",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," (0.7-0.8%)",["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"]," drop (10%)",["l","骷髅洞穴#Prehistoric Floors","Prehistoric Floors"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],"Crane Game in ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"]]],["Sell Price",["350g"]]]}